					"nextDialogs": [
						761190202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "努昂諾塔"
				},
				{
					"id": 761190202,
					"content": "#對{F#妳}{M#你}來說，是不是太簡單了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761190203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761190203,
					"content": "如果下次再玩的話，我會試著讓帽子們轉得更快一點。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761190204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761190204,
					"content": "我有一個疑問！所以哥倫比婭剛才是怎麼跟它們玩的呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761190205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761190205,
					"content": "不用月矩力的話就什麼都看不見，用了的話未免又看得太清楚…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761190206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761190206,
					"content": "我可以睜開眼睛啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761190207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761190207,
					"content": "呃，這是我的盲點…",
